flowchart TD
    A([START]) --> B[Patient Registration / Login]
    B --> C[Online Self-Registration]
    B --> D[Login phone + password]
    C --> E[Patient Dashboard]
    D --> E
    E --> F[New Visit - symptom entry]
    E --> G[Appointment today?]
    G -- yes --> H[Check-in - APPOINTMENT priority]
    F --> I[AI Department Recommendation]
    I --> J[Department Validation]
    J --> K[Doctor Selection<br/>available + shortest wait]
    H --> K
    K --> L[Queue number generation<br/>dynamic waiting time]
    L --> M{Rules checked?<br/>one active queue<br/>working hours<br/>capacity not full}
    M -- fail --> N[Reject / show error]
    M -- ok --> O[Add to WAITING queue]
    O --> P{Is emergency?}
    P -- yes --> Q[Staff confirmation]
    Q --> R[Confirmed - moved to front]
    P -- no --> S[Position + wait tracking]
    R --> T{Missed / expired?<br/>scheduler every 1 min}
    S --> T
    T -- yes --> U[EXPIRED + notify patient]
    T -- no --> V[Doctor: Call Next<br/>WAITING to CALLED]
    V --> W[Start Consultation<br/>CALLED to SERVING]
    W --> X[Pause <-> Resume]
    X --> Y[Complete<br/>SERVING to COMPLETED]
    Y --> Z([END])
